	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Praestantissimis simulque doctissimis viris, char<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>issimis fratribus, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae pastoribus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>et lectoribus, <persName ref="p2810">Erasmus Ritter</persName> gratiam <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et pacem optat a deo per Iesum Christum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Ut certiores vos faciam, praestantissimi viri, charissimi <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>fratres, confessionis nostrae<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Unten <ref target="file10527">Nr. 491</ref>.</note>, quam vestrae<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Oben <ref target="file10518">Nr. 482</ref>.</note> adiunximus, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>exemplar vobis exhibeo, tametsi reliqui fratres <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>si mihi, inquam, obtemperassent, plane nihil exceptis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nominibus addidissem.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Tam emuncta, tam ab<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>soluta vestra omnia extitere, ut non opus fuisset <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>rem dictam denuo dicere neque post <persName ref="p18514">Homerum</persName> Iliada c<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>anere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quod vero nos in numerum vestrum collocatis, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quod pro fratribus, symmistis adeoque membris <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>vestris agnoscitis, quod denique sub celeberrima vestra con<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>fessione tueri adversus calumnias Lutheranas copiam <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nobis et potestatem fecistis, habeo gratiam et habiturus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sum, quoad vivam, maximam, a quibus tam abest ut <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>separari cupiam, ut simul magis mori ex animo <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>optem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Vos interim vestro in nos amore pergite.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hoc <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>erit mihi tam gratum, quam quod gratissimum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>te.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Ex <placeName ref="l441">Schaffhusia</placeName>, 16. decembris 1534<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
